-- C3-1: CNC's data core (plan §4.1 reference data, §4.2 people and sign-in,
-- §4.8 audit, messages, enquiries and idempotency, and the StockItem model
-- from §4.6).
--
-- Purely additive: the database held no tables before this (the C1 migration
-- is empty), so nothing is dropped, renamed or narrowed.
--
-- The enums, tables, indexes and foreign keys down to the last AddForeignKey
-- were generated by `prisma migrate dev --name c3_core --create-only` against
-- the local cnc_db. Everything after the line "Hand-written below" is written
-- by hand and says so: CHECK constraints, the case-insensitive StockItem name
-- index, the append-only trigger on AuditLog, the human-number sequences and
-- the initial opening hours. Prisma cannot express any of them, so
-- `prisma migrate diff` against the schema stays empty with them applied.
--
-- Applied to CNC staging by hand with `migrate deploy` before the merge that
-- needs it, on the founder's go-ahead (docs/conventions.md, Data and
-- migrations). It reads and writes nothing of TAY's.

